WEBVTT

NOTE Original FV Mind R309 storyboard captions. No video encoded or linked. No product efficacy assertion.
NOTE Duration 42.000 seconds. Consent-safe draft; requires synchronization review after actual media edit.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The hardest part of twelve minutes isn't always concentration.
Sometimes it's the decision to begin.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
A guide can supply a beginning.
A recording can supply a sequence.
Neither guarantees the state you'll feel.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Zen12 is sold as a collection of short meditation sessions.
That format is something you can compare.
The advertised outcomes need separate evidence.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try a short free session first.
Notice whether what you need is guidance,
quiet, or simply a repeatable time.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Then read the actual package, limits and refund terms.
The evidence comes before the offer.
